# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Docker build context exclusions for the RBM Platform monorepo
# Keeps build context small and prevents secret leakage into images.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Dependency artifacts
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-ssr
**/build
**/.cache
**/.next
**/coverage
**/.nyc_output

# Source control & editor
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github
.vscode
.idea
*.sw?
*.suo
.DS_Store

# Environment files (NEVER bake into image)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.dev.example
!.env.staging.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Logs
**/logs
**/*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# OS junk
Thumbs.db

# Test artifacts
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.playwright-mcp

# Documentation (most of it). Keep root README if needed.
docs
**/*.md
!README.md

# Backups & local data
backups
**/uploads
**/upload
data

# Docker artifacts
docker-compose*.yml
Dockerfile*
.dockerignore

# CI / tooling
.replit
replit.md
.claude

# Local artifacts in repo root that aren't part of the build
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.doc
*.docx
*.pdf
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
cookies.txt
tasks_specific_activities.json
tier3_indicators.json
tier4_indicators.json
